description:
Agrégation groupée.

Params YAML:
    by: [col1, col2]          # colonnes de groupement
    agg:
      out_col: {func: sum, col: src_col}
      out_col2: {func: count, col: src_col2}
      out_col3: {func: mean, col: src_col3}

Fonctions supportées: sum, count, mean, avg, min, max, first, last
